{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the shoes of the ruggedly handsome, morally questionable space pilot, Caine McDowell, after being marooned on an alien planet trying to escape the terrifying bounty hunter, Porksley! Tap into your pilot intuition and strap yourself in, this is gonna be a bumpy ride!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Adventures of Caine McDowell&quot;  acts as a love letter to classic point-and-click adventure games, combining a classic, witty, sci-fi aesthetic with polished, action-packed gameplay  to create an epic experience for both newcomers and longstanding fans of the puzzle-adventure genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind-boggling puzzles with multiple solutions that have an impact on the rest of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-racing action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to toggle between classic point-and-click movement and modern WASD controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful, retro, pixel-art aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings (and even a secret one don't tell anybody ;] )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist HUD system to ensure maximum immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope to see you among the stars!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089590?t=1761348491","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089590/b9a2a1e85250754384582387ad43a0d3e3d72649/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761348491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089590/ed64816afa4e1aa47a686d7a8f24fcd4a61a897a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761348491","capsule_imagev5":"http